The files in this directory are in the PUBLIC DOMAIN.

sample-lecture.flac
  An excerpt of the LibriVox recording of "The Chemical History of a Candle"
  by Michael Faraday, Lecture I, read by Availle.
  LibriVox recordings are released into the public domain:
  https://librivox.org/pages/public-domain/
  Archive item (Public Domain Mark 1.0):
  https://archive.org/details/chemical_history_candle_ava_librivox

reference.txt
  The corresponding text of "The Chemical History of a Candle"
  (Michael Faraday, 1791-1867; published 1861), a public-domain work.

SOURCE.md
  Provenance notes for the two files above. To the extent possible under law,
